        "Does it have pricing present (either price_min or pricing_model=\"quote\")?",
        "Does it have at least 4 canonical benefits as per the provided list?",
        "Does its source_primary_url point to an official MAPFRE Colombia domain (*.mapfre.com.co or mapfre.com Colombia sections)?"
